  "description": "Experience the versatility with our carbon Road bike fork. Enjoy the pure essence of a road bike with 32mm tire clearance and a geometry designed for optimal comfort.\n\nBut if that’s not enough for you, choose our 2in1 flipchip fork and ride the MITTE Steel v3 as an All-Road bike with 35mm tire clearance.\n\nWhat’s more, our slider dropouts and flipchip fork make it a breeze to transform your bike into a gravel bike in no time.\n\nSTEEL FRAME\n\nSteel is incredibly versatile – just like the 8bar MITTE! The frame is manufactured of high-quality Reynolds 520 steel. Thanks to its durability, resilience and comfort it is the perfect material to meet the needs of commuters, nature lovers and bike packers. The classic and elegant design of the 8bar MITTE STEEL v3 bicycle is timeless, beautiful and strong at the same time. It comes in two different colours: matt black or deep sea blue metallic.\n\nDISC BRAKES\n\nDisc brakes are the most effective brakes in any terrain. When roads get muddy and dirty your safety is guaranteed.\n\nCAGE MOUNTS\n\nThe multiple cage mounts allow you to add bottles, fenders and bags to your bike. Numerous possibilities to be perfectly equipped for the next tour.\n\nSLIDER DROPOUTS\n\nThanks to our in-house developed slider dropouts, the 8bar MITTE STEEL can be easily converted. The bike's geometry adapts to your individual needs, enabling you to use various types of tires. This system also allows you to ride the 8bar MITTE STEEL as a Singlespeed bike or with an internal gear hub.",
